# Splunk SIEM Deployment Project

## Objective
Deployed and configured a Splunk Enterprise SIEM instance in a virtualized environment to practice log ingestion, network monitoring, and security data analysis.

## Key Accomplishments
- Successfully deployed Splunk on a Linux-based virtual machine.
- Configured network accessibility and firewall rules to enable remote web interface access.
- Troubleshot service availability and daemon stability.

